#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs.rst:44
#: c421ef6b737849c2ab0b5a40e2890f59
msgid ""
"This will replace ArduPilot’s internally generated INS/AHRS subsystems with "
"the external system. The MicroStrain system must be configured via `Sensor "
"Connect <https://www.microstrain.com/software/sensorconnect>`__ before use. "
"See the below section on data rates."
msgstr ""
"这将用外部系统替代 ArduPilot 内部生成的 INS/AHRS 子系统。MicroStrain 系统必须通过 `Sensor Connect "
"<https://www.microstrain.com/software/sensorconnect>`__ "
"在使用前完成配置。请参阅以下数据速率章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs.rst:50
#: 8be8bb9413f84a0fad1a9f0cea23a461
msgid "MicroStrain7"
msgstr "MicroStrain7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs.rst:52
#: 77ce3ca636d944c5a64508136193c0aa
msgid ""
"The 3DM-GQ7 supports up to 230k baud on the 3.3V TTL serial interface. The "
"RS-232 interface supports higher baud rates, but most autopilots do not come"
" with RS-232 interfaces."
msgstr ""
"3DM-GQ7 在 3.3V TTL 串口接口上最高支持 230k 波特率。RS-232 接口支持更高波特率，但大多数飞控不提供 RS-232 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs.rst:55
#: 9071fedeb3ac454c9de5a0e56ef8c738
msgid ""
"To use the 3DM-GQ7 with 230k baud in ArduPilot, set the following data rates"
" in SensorConnect."
msgstr "要在 ArduPilot 中以 230k 波特率使用 3DM-GQ7，请在 SensorConnect 中设置以下数据速率。"

