#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs.rst:99
#: e853e4e348ec425b9fe9a8dd1dc99844
msgid ""
"This rates work well for platforms that run the EKF at 50Hz, such as Plane, "
"Sub, Blimp. MicroStrain hardware and firmware for higher baud rates than "
"230k is in development. With higher baud rates, MicroStrain7 should be "
"suitable for Copter and QuadPlane."
msgstr ""
"这些速率适用于以 50Hz 运行 EKF 的平台，例如 Plane、Sub、Blimp。针对更高波特率（超过 230k）的 MicroStrain "
"硬件和固件正在开发中。有了更高波特率，MicroStrain7 应能适用于 Copter 和 QuadPlane。"
